# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DECIDED, not forgotten (2026-08-13). The blog essays are published on
# vitalyreznik.com and are the curator's outward-facing copy; a second copy on
# GitHub would only rot out of step with the live one. They are ignored here so
# that "untracked" cannot be misread as "somebody forgot to commit this" —
# which is exactly how `dilemmas/cogito.py` sat outside the repository for
# months and then turned CI red the day a stand was wired to it. An explicit
# decision belongs in the machine, not in someone's memory.
essays/
Reproduce-ZTL.docx
